  "name": "Linux IPv4 Forwarding Disabled",
  "former_names": [
    "IP Forwarding Disabled",
    "Linux IP Forwarding Disabled"
  ],
  "description": "Ensures the kernel parameter net.ipv4.ip_forward is 0 so the host does not route traffic between interfaces. Container hosts and routers legitimately enable forwarding; exclude them from this rule's group.",
